Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 18:32:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 29/32] manager: add rescan control to the app picker

The installed-app list was loaded once at startup, so a target installed while
the manager was already open (the common case when preparing a sample) never
appeared and could not be selected. Add ViewModel.rescanApplications() to reload
just the list without touching the draft, and surface it as the search bar's
trailing action whenever the query is empty (the clear button still takes over
once text is entered).
